# macOS
.DS_Store

# Internal tracking. Anchored with a leading slash deliberately: git matches a
# bare `todo.md` pattern at ANY depth, so an unanchored entry here would also
# swallow e.g. `docs/todo.md` in a project that wants to commit one.
/todo.md
